"the 3.2 line. Bug fixes and minor feature changes are applied here."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:42
msgid ""
"`3.1.x <http://github.com/phpbb/phpbb/tree/3.1.x>`_ - Development branch of "
"the stable 3.1 line. phpBB 3.1 has reached its End of Life and is therefore "
