#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:47
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Tags"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:48
msgid ""
"Tags are released versions. Stable ones get merged into the master branch."
msgstr ""
"Tags are released versions. Stable ones get merged into the master branch."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:50
msgid "release-3.Y.Z-aX - Alpha release X of the 3.Y.Z line."
msgstr "release-3.Y.Z-aX - Alpha release X of the 3.Y.Z line."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:51
msgid "release-3.Y.Z-bX - Beta release X of the 3.Y.Z line."
msgstr "release-3.Y.Z-bX - Beta release X of the 3.Y.Z line."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:52
msgid "release-3.Y.Z-RCX - Release candidate X of the stable 3.Y.Z release."
msgstr "release-3.Y.Z-RCX - Release candidate X of the stable 3.Y.Z release."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:53
msgid "release-3.Y.Z - Stable 3.Y.Z release."
msgstr "release-3.Y.Z - Stable 3.Y.Z release."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:54
msgid "release-2.0.X - Deprecated stable 2.0.X release."
msgstr "release-2.0.X - Deprecated stable 2.0.X release."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:56
msgid ""
"This means all bug-fix development should take place on the 3.2.x branch, "
"and will be merged into higher branches, including master. All feature "
"development should take place in master. Read more about the workflow in the "
"next section."
msgstr ""
"This means all bug-fix development should take place on the 3.2.x branch, "
"and will be merged into higher branches, including master. All feature "
"development should take place in master. Read more about the workflow in the "
"next section."

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:61
msgid "How to contribute?"
msgstr "How to contribute?"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:62
msgid ""
"When fixing a bug, please post in the `bug tracker <https://tracker.phpbb."
"com>`__. When adding a feature to 3.x post your patch for review in a new "
"topic on the `[3.x] Discussion forum <https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/"
"viewforum.php?f=81>`__ at Area51. Please either provide a link to your "
"commit or branch on GitHub or attach a patch created with ``git format-"
"patch``. For larger features or changes consider adding it as an idea to "
"`phpBB Ideas <https://www.phpbb.com/community/ideas>`_ or posting an RFC on "
"Area51 first."
msgstr ""
"When fixing a bug, please post in the `bug tracker <https://tracker.phpbb."
"com>`__. When adding a feature to 3.x post your patch for review in a new "
"topic on the `[3.x] Discussion forum <https://area51.phpbb.com/phpBB/"
"viewforum.php?f=81>`__ at Area51. Please either provide a link to your "
"commit or branch on GitHub or attach a patch created with ``git format-"
"patch``. For larger features or changes consider adding it as an idea to "
"`phpBB Ideas <https://www.phpbb.com/community/ideas>`_ or posting an RFC on "
"Area51 first."

