msgid "An example:"
msgstr "An example:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:124
msgid ""
"The structure of a commit message which is verified by the commit-msg hook "
"is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"The structure of a commit message which is verified by the commit-msg hook "
"is as follows:"

#: ../../devdocs-source-copy/development/git.rst:135
msgid ""
"The required components are the summary, branch, and list of tickets; the "
"description is optional. Both the description and ticket list must be "
"preceded by a **single** empty line. The description element is unrestricted "
"length and may contain any number of empty lines to separate paragraphs; "
"each ticket in the list must be on its own line. If the branch is a "
"[ticket/] branch, the ticket list must contain a matching ticket, finally "
"the ticket list may not contain any duplicates."
msgstr ""
"The required components are the summary, branch, and list of tickets; the "
"description is optional. Both the description and ticket list must be "
"preceded by a **single** empty line. The description element is unrestricted "
"length and may contain any number of empty lines to separate paragraphs; "
"each ticket in the list must be on its own line. If the branch is a "
"[ticket/] branch, the ticket list must contain a matching ticket, finally "
"the ticket list may not contain any duplicates."

